cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite
  Koren (2008), whose models it implements.
type: software
title: "svdpp: SVD++ and Asymmetric-SVD Recommender Models"
abstract: >-
  Latent factor models for collaborative filtering from Koren (2008):
  SVD++, Asymmetric-SVD and the regularised baseline predictor, written in
  R without compiled code, estimated by stochastic gradient descent or
  L-BFGS-B with sparse-matrix gradients.
authors:
  - family-names: Barta
    given-names: Akos
    email: akos.barnabas.barta@wu.ac.at
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2933-3902"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/akosbarta/svdpp"
url: "https://github.com/akosbarta/svdpp"
keywords:
  - R
  - recommender systems
  - collaborative filtering
  - matrix factorization
  - SVD++
  - Asymmetric-SVD
  - implicit feedback
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: >-
      Factorization Meets the Neighborhood: A Multifaceted Collaborative
      Filtering Model
    authors:
      - family-names: Koren
        given-names: Yehuda
    collection-title: >-
      Proceedings of the 14th ACM SIGKDD International Conference on
      Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining (KDD '08)
    year: 2008
    start: 426
    end: 434
    publisher:
      name: ACM
    doi: 10.1145/1401890.1401944
